  "details": "Any person who's crouching will have their head tilted down(20º-45º downwards depending on how much they crouch). Locally, they don't notice it since it only looks like that for other people\n\nHow to replicate this bug:\n-Go into any world instance with someone else\n-Ask them to crouch down\n-Notice how they're looking at the floor when they're actually looking straight forward on their end\n\nFrom what I've seen this does not apply to full body users",
